flowchart TD
    A["混合工作流设计（Hybrid workflow）"] --> B["模型步：处理歧义、综合、诊断（Model step for judgment）"]
    B --> C["输出可查状态：文件路径、测试结果、状态码（Emits checkable state）"]
    C --> D["确定性轨道：脚本、测试、校验器（Deterministic rail checks it）"]
    D --> E{"轨道通过？（Rail passes?）"}
    E -- "否：漂移被拦下" --> F["回到模型修正（Back to the model）"]
    F --> B
    E -- "是" --> G{"还有待判断的环节？（More judgment ahead?）"}
    G -- "有：继续交替" --> B
    G -- "无" --> H["模型不必完美，轨道接住漂移（Neither layer must be perfect）"]
    classDef core fill:#1a5fd0,stroke:#12449e,color:#ffffff;
    classDef gate fill:#fdf0ef,stroke:#e0b4b4,color:#8a3a34;
    classDef out fill:#edf1f7,stroke:#c9d6e6,color:#182430;
    class B,C,D,F core;
    class E,G gate;
    class A,H out;
